  "related": [
    "全屏加载动画（进度型）"
  ],
  "prompt": "【环形进度 Radial Progress】目标：一个局部小组件——上传进度卡，左边圆环进度、中间百分比数字，右边文件名 + 已传/总量 + 状态文字；进度增长时弧线平滑变长、数字同步跳动，完成时圆环变绿、数字换成直线 SVG 对勾。和「全屏加载动画（进度型）」区分：那是整屏遮罩的加载流程，这是嵌在卡片/列表里的局部小进度。\n\n1) 结构：.wrap（横向 flex）> .dial（相对定位方块）+ .info（文件名 / 副标题 / 状态+重播按钮）；.dial 里 svg（viewBox 0 0 100 100，两个 circle：track 轨道 r=44、bar 进度弧 r=44）+ .center（百分比数字与对勾叠在同一格）。\n2) 环：stroke-width 6、linecap round；弧长 CIRC = 2π×44 ≈ 276.46，dasharray = CIRC，dashoffset = CIRC×(1-p) 由 JS 每帧写；svg 整体 transform:rotate(-90deg) 让起点在正上方；轨道 stroke 用 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)。\n3) 动画：requestAnimationFrame 跑 2 秒，缓动 1-(1-t)^2.2（前快后慢）；同一帧同步写三处：dashoffset、百分比数字（tabular-nums）、aria-valuenow；数字和弧必须同帧更新，否则数字会「跳」。\n4) 完成态：.dial.done 让弧变 --ui-success；中心百分比淡出缩到 .86，SVG 对勾从 scale(.6) 弹回 1（cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)，0.3 秒）；状态文字变「已完成」并切 --ui-success。\n5) 交互：点「重播」重新从 0 跑一次；真实项目里每帧进度来自上传回调，不要自己造时间轴。\n6) 无障碍：外层 role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow 同步更新，aria-label 说明用途；完成态 aria-valuenow=100。\n7) 坑：对勾必须是 SVG 折线不能是字符（字符对勾换字体就会歪）；环的尺寸用媒体查询切换（弹窗 180px、卡片 88–96px），数字/对勾尺寸要跟着改，否则对勾会被撑满圆环；不要在圆环里再叠旋转光点（会和光标扩散光圈撞类名）。演示光标创建后会被 helper 的 requestAnimationFrame 自动显示，要延后 120ms 再 hide，否则会停在视口中心挡住文字。\n8) 配色：弧用 var(--ui-brand)、完成用 var(--ui-success)、轨道用 text 12% 透明混合，全走 --ui-*。\n9) 自动演示：包在 if(!window.__uiInteractive) 里循环：进度 0→100 跑 2.1 秒 → 完成态停 1 秒 → 光标点「重播」→ 重新开始；弹窗里静态停在 62%，点重播才跑。\n10) 使用场景：能拿到真实进度的局部任务（上传/下载/导出/存储用量），嵌在卡片或列表里；拿不到进度改用骨架屏或不确定 spinner，别放进整屏遮罩（那是「全屏加载动画」的活）。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\nbody{background:radial-gradient(600px 360px at 50% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 7%,transparent),transparent 70%),var(--ui-bg)}\n\n.wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;max-width:100%;min-width:0}\n.dial{position:relative;flex:0 0 auto;width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:50%}\n.dial>svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;transform:rotate(-90deg)}\n.track{fill:none;stroke:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);stroke-width:6}\n.bar{fill:none;stroke:var(--ui-brand);stroke-width:6;stroke-linecap:round;transition:stroke .3s ease}\n.dial.done .bar{stroke:var(--ui-success)}\n.center{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.center>*{grid-area:1/1;place-self:center}\n.pct{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1px;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;transition:opacity .25s ease,transform .25s ease}\n.pct small{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.tick{opacity:0;transform:scale(.6);transition:opacity .3s ease,transform .3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);color:var(--ui-success)}\n.tick svg{display:block;width:26px;height:26px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.dial.done .pct{opacity:0;transform:scale(.86)}\n.dial.done .tick{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}\n\n.info{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n.info b{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.info .sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:3px;min-width:0}\n.state{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-brand);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.dial.done ~ .info .state,.done-state .state{color:var(--ui-success)}\n.again{margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:9px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,color .15s ease,border-color .15s ease}\n.again:hover{color:var(--ui-text);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent)}\n.again.pressing,.again:active{transform:scale(.94)}\n\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  .wrap{gap:30px;padding:24px 30px}\n  .dial{width:180px;height:180px}\n  .pct{font-size:38px}\n  .pct small{font-size:15px}\n  .tick svg{width:48px;height:48px}\n  .info b{font-size:18px}\n  .info .sub{font-size:13px}\n  .state{font-size:12px}\n  .foot{margin-top:8px;gap:12px}\n  .again{font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .wrap{gap:14px;padding:10px 14px}\n  .dial{width:88px;height:88px}\n  .info b{font-size:11px}\n  .info .sub{font-size:9px}\n  .again{font-size:8px;padding:3px 8px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .pct,.tick,.bar,.again{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"dial\" id=\"dial\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-label=\"上传进度\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <circle class=\"track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"44\"></circle>\n      <circle class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"44\"></circle>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"center\">\n      <div class=\"pct\"><span id=\"num\">0</span><small>%</small></div>\n      <div class=\"tick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"info\" id=\"info\">\n    <b>上传 项目原型.zip</b>\n    <span class=\"sub\" id=\"sub\">12.8 MB / 32 MB · 1.2 MB/s</span>\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <span class=\"state\" id=\"state\">准备上传…</span>\n      <button class=\"again\" id=\"again\" type=\"button\">重播</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var dial = document.getElementById('dial'),\n      bar = document.getElementById('bar'),\n      num = document.getElementById('num'),\n      state = document.getElementById('state'),\n      info = document.getElementById('info'),\n      again = document.getElementById('again');\n\n  var CIRC = 2 * Math.PI * 44;\n  bar.style.strokeDasharray = CIRC + '';\n  bar.style.strokeDashoffset = CIRC + '';\n\n  var rafId = 0, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n      setTimeout(function(){ if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 120);\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function stateFor(p){\n    if(p < 0.3) return '上传中…';\n    if(p < 1) return '正在校验…';\n    return '已完成';\n  }\n\n  function setProgress(p){\n    p = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, p));\n    bar.style.strokeDashoffset = (CIRC * (1 - p)).toFixed(2);\n    num.textContent = String(Math.round(p * 100));\n    dial.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', String(Math.round(p * 100)));\n    if(!dial.classList.contains('done')){\n      var msg = stateFor(p);\n      if(state.textContent !== msg) state.textContent = msg;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function reset(){\n    dial.classList.remove('done');\n    info.classList.remove('done-state');\n    setProgress(0);\n    state.textContent = '准备上传…';\n  }\n\n  function runProgress(duration, afterDone){\n    cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);\n    var t0 = performance.now();\n    function step(now){\n      var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / duration);\n      var eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 2.2);\n      setProgress(eased);\n      if(t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n      else {\n        if(afterDone) afterDone();\n      }\n    }\n    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n  }\n\n  function finish(){\n    setProgress(1);\n    dial.classList.add('done');\n    info.classList.add('done-state');\n    state.textContent = '已完成';\n  }\n\n  again.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    clearTimers();\n    reset();\n    runProgress(2000, finish);\n  });\n\n  function tap(el, done){\n    if(!cursor){ done && done(); return; }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(el);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      el.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        done && done();\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);\n    reset();\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(cursor && typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(function(){ runProgress(2000, finish); }, 400);\n      later(demoCycle, 3600);\n      return;\n    }\n    later(function(){ runProgress(2100, finish); }, 350);\n    later(function(){ tap(again, function(){ demoCycle(); }); }, 3400);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    /* 弹窗：静态停在 62%，点「重播」跑一次 */\n    setProgress(0.62);\n    state.textContent = '正在校验…';\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
